# Google Maps — do'kon nuqtasini xaritadan tanlash uchun.
#
# ⚠️ Bu ALOHIDA kalit. Mobil ilovadagi Android/iOS kalitlari web'da
# ishlamaydi va aksincha.
#
# Google Cloud Console:
#   1. APIs & Services → Enable → "Maps JavaScript API"
#      ❌ Places API YOQILMAYDI (K-05)
#   2. Credentials → API key
#   3. Application restrictions → HTTP referrers:
#         https://panel.looksave.app/*
#         http://localhost:5173/*        (faqat ishlab chiqish uchun)
#   4. API restrictions → faqat "Maps JavaScript API"
#
# Kalit berilmasa panel baribir ishlaydi: xarita o'rniga koordinatani
# qo'lda kiritish maydoni qoladi.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
